      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The documentation says \"Use Constraints instead\", but they're NOT allowed in Quest environment. So because of lack of VRC_IKFollower and Constraints, some avatar gimmicks can't be migrated to AV3.\nFrom this point of view, some advanced avatar creators can't realize their excellent ideas in AV3. I hope VRC_IKFollower comes back again, or Contraints are allowed for Quest avatars.",
